  "goodToKnow": "Die Koordination is coordination, both organisational (die Koordination der Hilfsmaßnahmen) and physical (Auge-Hand-Koordination). Koordinieren means to coordinate, and der Koordinator a coordinator. Germany's federal system often makes Koordination between Bund and Länder slow, a frequent topic in the news. Pronounce the two o's separately: ko-or-di-na-TSYOHN. Like all -tion nouns, it's feminine. It has no plural."
